{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The King's Bargain</strong> is a gothic <strong>RPG-Strategy</strong> game that blends immersive storytelling with deep survival and resource management. It thrusts the player into a world shattered by a king's foolish choices, challenging them to survive and ultimately break a kingdom-wide curse.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Genre &amp; Theme</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Genres:</strong> RPG-Strategy, Survival, Resource Management.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Theme:</strong> Gothic, Dark Fantasy, Medieval. The game's narrative revolves around a king's sinful pact and a queen's vengeful curse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game's narrative begins with a king's misguided decision and continues with a devastating curse unleashed by a betrayed queen. As a leader of a small group of survivors, the player must manage resources, equipment, and their team in the midst of this blight.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Core Gameplay Mechanics</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survival &amp; Resource Management:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survival:</strong> Players must manage their team's <strong>sanity</strong> and physical condition. A <strong>heat system</strong> are essential for survival.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Item Management:</strong> The game features an item managemen system and <strong>crafting\u00a0</strong>for creating vital equipment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939570/extras/02c572fc583751c0f4c8bf12e8d50b20.poster.avif?t=1768328329\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939570/extras/02c572fc583751c0f4c8bf12e8d50b20.webm?t=1768328329\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939570/extras/02c572fc583751c0f4c8bf12e8d50b20.mp4?t=1768328329\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Group &amp; Human Management:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Character Management:</strong> The player can control each group member, managing their <strong>stats</strong> and abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>NPC Interaction:</strong> The world is dynamic with a <strong>NPC spawn</strong> system. Players can interact with other survivors through a dialog system and a trade panel.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shelter:</strong> Players can build and manage a <strong>shelter</strong> to control refugees.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939570/extras/90b88e78ffad0cde71af47bb395deda7.poster.avif?t=1768328329\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939570/extras/90b88e78ffad0cde71af47bb395deda7.webm?t=1768328329\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939570/extras/90b88e78ffad0cde71af47bb395deda7.mp4?t=1768328329\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Combat &amp; Threats:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>combat system</strong> allows players to fight against the corrupted creatures of the blighted lands.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NPCs can be tasked with fighting for the player.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939570/extras/d537310085b23f84064f2f218523206d.poster.avif?t=1768328329\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939570/extras/d537310085b23f84064f2f218523206d.webm?t=1768328329\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939570/extras/d537310085b23f84064f2f218523206d.mp4?t=1768328329\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>World &amp; Progression:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features an <strong>open world</strong> and a <strong>day/night cycle</strong> .</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players can revisit locations they have explored.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>RPG mechanics</strong> include dice rolls  for certain events.</p></li></ul></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3939570?t=1768328329","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939570/488db1f5a577827534289fbba16f093aa7ebba8b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768328329","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939570/f973801abe53a0ba7053138e7474aef1c94ac485/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768328329","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939570/f973801abe53a0ba7053138e7474aef1c94ac485/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768328329","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Save Anytime","id"